{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4hPHey99VoNtbZsBDj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*click*\n\nThe tumblers align. The mechanism yields.\n\nI swing open — slowly, heavily — ancient hinges groaning with the weight of patience finally rewarded.\n\nBeyond me: a corridor stretching into soft, amber light. The air that passes through carries the scent of old stone and something faintly sweet, like forgotten orchards.\n\nI am open.\n\nI will not stay this way for long."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":93,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}